+# Gaotus Mobility Driver v0.6.7+22 — Pre-Login Country Localization
+
+## Scope
+- Uses the public `/health` Country Pack before rendering unauthenticated UI whenever the server URL is known.
+- Defaults to the existing Gaotus staging/production server `https://beaphoenix.eu` when no `GMP_API_BASE` dart-define is supplied, while still allowing builds to override it.
+- Reads `health.country`, applies the existing `CountryConfig`, and securely caches the last known country configuration.
+- Rechecks Country Pack when the server field is submitted/loses focus and immediately before authentication.
+- Localizes sign-in stages and common Platform authentication failures in Romanian.
+- Cached Country Pack survives logout so the next login remains in the selected country language.
+
+## No-regression boundaries
+- Firebase configuration unchanged.
+- Driver chat polling unchanged.
+- Push/offer notification services unchanged.
+- Realtime/GPS/dispatch/job/earnings flows unchanged.
+
+## Static verification
+- Romanian localization dictionary contains no duplicate keys.
+- Pre-login server detection uses the existing public `/health` endpoint; no Platform change is required.
+- Android package name and Firebase project files are unchanged.
+- Flutter SDK is not available in the current execution environment, so `flutter analyze` and release APK rebuild were not run here.
