+## v0.6.7 Pre-Login Country Localization
+- Loads Country Pack from the public `/health` endpoint before login whenever the server is known.
+- Caches the last known country/language and refreshes it when the server URL is entered or authentication starts.
+- Localizes sign-in progress and common authentication errors.
